~ start
Brian: What.. where am I?
Brian: Did I escape?
Brian: Wait, where are the others???
Brian: Dan!! Alice!! Margaret!!
Brian: No, no, no, no, no.... this cannot be happening
Brian: I can't be the only one who made it out..
=> END

~ start2
Brian: MARGARET!!! ALICE!!! DAN!!
Brian: Please, anyone!!!
Brian: No, no...
Brian: Not like this... not when it's all my fault...
Brian: We should never have came here...
Brian: MARGARET!!! ALICE!!! DAN!!
=> END

~ start3
Brian: I need to find them!
Brian: I need to make sure they are safe
Brian: Where is the house
Brian: Where did it go!?
Brian: It was right here, it could not have disappeared...
Brian: Unless it did...
Brian: Unless they are gone...
=> END
~ start4
Brian: [Sobs]
Brian: This, this cannot be how it ends
Brian: I brought them here
Brian: I suggested this place
Brian: I was the one who wanted to face his fears
Brian: Why do I get to leave
Brian: Why do they get to die, just because they were my friends
Brian: [Sobs]
Brian: I have to find them.. have to find some way of reaching them
Brian: TAKE ME INSTEAD YOU DEMONS!!! LET THEM GO!!
Brian: ....
Brian: It's useless
Brian: That house does not yield to reason
Brian: Only maddness
Brian: I need to find more about that place
Brian: What it is, how it works
Brian: A way to rescue them
Brian: I must go
=> END